The Counsel for the applicant has argued on the points mentioned in the impugned application and in support of his arguments, has also relied upon following rulings:-
1. RS Nayak versus A.R. Antulay and others reported in (1992) 1 SCC 279;
2. A.R. Antulay versus RS Nayak and others reported in (1988) 2 SCC 602.
